'''A New Legend''' (真・伝説のはじまり, ''Shin・Densetsu no Hajimari'', Beginning of the True Legend) is the 1st sub-chapter of [[Uncanny Legends]], and the 50th sub-chapter overall. It was introduced in [[Version 7.0 Update|Version 7.0]] and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty.

Upon completing its only stage, the player will be able to unlock the [[True Form]] of [[Mecha-Bun (Special Cat)|Mecha-Bun]] as well the ability to upgrade most cats 10 more levels using [[Catseye]]s including [[:Category:Mythic Cats|Mythic Cats]].

==Difficulty==
As this sub-chapter contains only [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic Enemies]], it should be regarded a warm-up before the true potential of the Curse effect is put to use. However, it shouldn't be discounted because of it, for Relics are very, very strong.
{{LegendDiff|150|200|100}}

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces two new enemies of the new enemy trait, [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]]. These enemies' gimmick, aside from having extremely high stats overall, is the ability to afflict cats with the Curse status effect. This effect disables a cat's anti-trait [[Special Abilities|Abilities]] for a given amount of time.
*[[Relic Doge]]: An extremely buffed, Relic variant of [[Doge]] that is able to inflict Curse.
*[[Relic Bun-Bun|Relic Bun Bun]]: The Relic version of [[Mecha-Bun (Enemy)|Mecha-Bun]]. It attacks even faster than Mecha-Bun, has a 100% chance to inflict Curse, and is surprisingly not a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy.
This is also the first sub-chapter able to drop [[Ototo Corps|Ammonites]] as materials, allowing players to upgrade certain [[Cat Cannon]]s up to level 30. However, it is not recommended for farming, as the next sub-chapters have much cheaper and easier stages.

