==Trivia==
*Aside from [[Ms. Sign]], this sub-chapter only contains one type of enemy, that being Relic.
*This is the first Uncanny Legends sub-chapter to not have six stages, the second being [[Imminent Disaster]], the third being [[Humanity Catified]], and the fourth being [[Sacred Forest]].
*This is the shortest Uncanny Legends sub-chapter, tied with [[Imminent Disaster]] and [[Sacred Forest]].
**However, it appears that Imminent Disaster was possibly planned to include 5 additional stages, due to the existence of 5 placeholder stages in the code that are exact copies of stages 2-6 of [[Here Be Dragons]]. <!-- Questionable. Seems more like PONOS copied and pasted and forgot to remove it. -->

